<node id="UE's usage setting">
  <data key="entity_id">UE's usage setting</data>
  <data key="entity_type">Concept</data>
  <data key="description">UE's usage setting is defined in 3GPP TS 24.301 [15] and applies to voice capable UEs in 5GS. It indicates whether the UE has a preference for voice services over data services or vice versa. Voice services include IMS voice, and data services include any kind of user data transfer without a voice media component. The setting can be configured as "voice centric" or "data centric". If the UE is capable of S1 mode, a single UE's usage setting applies to both modes.</data>
  <data key="source_id">chunk-4ae2a4e75e3d537b881977cd5936a0a2</data>
  <data key="file_path">../3GPP-trunked/Rel-19/24_series/24501-j20.md4.3.1</data>
  <data key="created_at">1770205570</data>
  <data key="source_file">Rel-19/24_series/24501-j20/graph_chunk_entity_relation.graphml</data>
  <data key="release">Rel-19</data>
  <data key="raw_entity_id">UE's usage setting</data>
</node>
